Setting an <a href="../../context/ApplicationContext.html" title="interface in org.springframework.context"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> is optional: If set, registered
tasks will be activated in the <a href="../../context/event/ContextRefreshedEvent.html" title="class in org.springframework.context.event"><code>ContextRefreshedEvent</code></a> phase;
if not set, it will happen at <a href="#afterSingletonsInstantiated()"><code>afterSingletonsInstantiated()</code></a> time.
